<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Sign In</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            background-color: #f0f2f5;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .container {
            display: flex;
            width: 900px;
            height: 600px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0052D4 0%, #4364F7 100%);
            border-radius: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
        }

        .left-panel {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: flex-start;
            padding: 60px;
            color: #ffffff;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .left-panel::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -150px;
            left: -150px;
            width: 400px;
            height: 400px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            border-radius: 50%;
            filter: blur(50px);
            z-index: 0;
        }

        .left-panel::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -100px;
            right: -100px;
            width: 300px;
            height: 300px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            border-radius: 50%;
            filter: blur(50px);
            z-index: 0;
        }

        .welcome-text {
            font-size: 48px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .headline-text {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .description-text {
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        .right-panel {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 40px;
        }

        .login-form {
            width: 380px;
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .sign-in-title {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            align-self: flex-start;
        }

        .form-description {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            align-self: flex-start;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        .input-group {
            width: 100%;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .input-group input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #333;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
        }

        .input-group input::placeholder {
            color: #aaa;
        }

        .input-group input:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #007bff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(0, 123, 255, 0.25);
        }

        .password-group {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .password-group input {
            flex-grow: 1;
            margin-right: 10px;
        }

        .password-show {
            color: #007bff;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
            cursor: pointer;
            opacity: 0.8;
            transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
        }

        .password-show:hover {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .remember-forgot {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            width: 100%;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .remember-me {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            color: #555;
        }

        .remember-me input[type="checkbox"] {
            margin-right: 8px;
            accent-color: #007bff;
            transform: scale(1.1);
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .forgot-password {
            color: #007bff;
            text-decoration: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            opacity: 0.8;
            transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
        }

        .forgot-password:hover {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .sign-in-button {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 15px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0052D4 0%, #4364F7 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(67, 100, 247, 0.3);
        }

        .sign-in-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(67, 100, 247, 0.4);
        }

        .signup-prompt {
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #555;
        }

        .signup-link {
            color: #007bff;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="left-panel">
            <h1 class="welcome-text">WELCOME</h1>
            <h2 class="headline-text">YOUR HEADLINE NAME</h2>
            <p class="description-text">
                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit, sed diam nonummy nibh euismod tincidunt ut laoreet dolore magna aliquam erat volutpat. Ut wisi enim ad minim quis nostrud exerci tation.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="right-panel">
            <div class="login-form">
                <h3 class="sign-in-title">Sign in</h3>
                <p class="form-description">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit</p>
                <div class="input-group">
                    <input type="text" id="username" name="username" placeholder="User name">
                </div>
                <div class="input-group password-group">
                    <input type="password" id="password" name="password" placeholder="Password">
                    <span class="password-show">SHOW</span>
                </div>
                <div class="remember-forgot">
                    <label class="remember-me">
                        <input type="checkbox">
                        Remember me
                    </label>
                    <a href="#" class="forgot-password">Forgot Password?</a>
                </div>
                <button class="sign-in-button">Sing In</button>
                <p class="signup-prompt">Don't have an account? <a href="#" class="signup-link">Sign Up</a></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>